'''Dark Lazer''' (暗黒嬢 ''Ankoku Jō'', '''Dark Lady''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

