==Enemy==
This enemy is a force to be reckoned with: she has huge amounts of health, great DPS and only a few knockbacks. Thankfully, she is considered a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy, which means she can be affected by the abilities of [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark Cats]].

==Strategy==
[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] is a good Cat to bring up against this Enemy. Don't try to use [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] to freeze her, as Bombercat is outranged. Several [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] and [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rares]] also work well against her, as well as good generalist Ubers and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]].

